name: Misprint — high mult roll
author: corpus
description: >-
  Event: Misprint Joker rolls a high Mult value. Tight Ante 1 event: Misprint provides a
  big multiplier.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - misprintMult: [1]
should:
  - joker: Misprint
    score: 45
  - joker: Seltzer
    score: 30
  - joker: Dusk
    score: 25
